    "encrypted": "false",
    "display_name": "Implement Try Catch Error",
    "long_instructions": "# Implement Try Catch Error Handling\r\n\r\n**Goal:** Prevent your app from breaking when the API fails or returns an error.\r\n\r\n1. **Wrap Your Fetch in Try Catch:** Place your async fetch logic inside a try block.\r\n2. **Catch Errors Safely:** Use a catch block to handle any errors that occur.\r\n3. **Show a Helpful Message:** Display a clear, user-friendly error message such as \"Could not load data. Please try again.\"\r\n4. **Avoid Silent Failures:** Make sure the app does not freeze or stay blank if the fetch fails.\r\n5. **Test It:** Temporarily break your API URL to confirm your error message appears.\r\n",
    "bubble_choice_description": "Protect your app from crashing by wrapping your fetch logic in try catch and displaying a helpful error message if something goes wrong. ***(supports completing Milestone 3 tasks)***",
